            <ArticleTitle>Fatal coronary atherosclerotic heart disease in a Nigerian case report with necropsy findings.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>219-23</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report describes the clinical and necropsy findings in a fatal case of coronary atherosclerotic heart disease with thrombosis occurring in a Nigerian. This entity is very rarely seen in indigenous Africans, except in the setting of hypertension, diabetes mellitus or high socioeconomic status.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
